<title>NEW ZEALAND: Radio Pacific half year profit slips.</title>
<headline>Radio Pacific half year profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				0.71 vs 1.1</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   16.0 vs 16.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			   10.0 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				5.26 vs 5.34</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 1.64 vs 1.55</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.59 vs 0.49</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    debit  0.35 vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    6.69 vs same</p>
<p>    Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>    Pay date Dec 20</p>
<p>    Reg date Dec 13</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 16</p>
<p>Note - Radio Pacific Ltd is a radio station.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
